WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:03.560 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
Ġewwa werqa, strutturi żgħar imsejħa kloroplasti fihom

2
00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:06.890 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
il-klorofilla, pigment li jaqbad l-enerġija tad-dawl.

3
00:00:08.167 --> 00:00:11.952 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
L-għeruq jipprovdu l-ilma. Pori żgħar fil-weraq idaħħlu

4
00:00:11.952 --> 00:00:14.360 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
d-dijossidu tal-karbonju mill-arja.

5
00:00:16.167 --> 00:00:19.653 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
Il-fotosinteżi tuża l-enerġija tad-dawl biex tibdel l-ilma

6
00:00:19.653 --> 00:00:23.020 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
u d-dijossidu tal-karbonju f’zokkor li jsostni l-pjanta.

7
00:00:24.167 --> 00:00:27.972 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
Matul il-proċess jinħeles l-ossiġnu. Id-dinja ħadra ta’

8
00:00:27.972 --> 00:00:31.570 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
madwarna tagħmel il-kimika bid-dawl tax-xemx kuljum.
